message: "If you use or discuss this release, please cite Resolutive Science v0.3.0."
title: "Resolutive Science: RCMS Falsification Release"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Matos"
    given-names: "Marcelo Roldão"
